Recommends: xdg-desktop-portal, pipewire
Description: Deepin-HarmonyOS-Bridge
 DHB connects OpenHarmony/KaihongOS devices with Deepin/UOS desktops.
 This package provides the dhb CLI and the core file/clipboard bridge.
 .
 The screen-sharing and system-level dsoftbus features are delivered in a
 later release and require additional system integration.
